    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Hook</i> into an intergalactic adventure with Scark'Tee, a fearless Naal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This <strong>3D platformer game based on hook physics</strong> offers a wild experience of speed and skill for players seeking a challenge, while providing <strong>free-roaming mechanics</strong> to discover the secrets of Naltiune as you improve the environment around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Latch onto an intergalactic adventure with Scark'Tee, a fearless Naals, and uncover the secrets of Naltiune, an inhospitable moon on the planet Aqueora, inhabited solely by the agile Naals. <strong>With his long tail, Scark'Tee swings, fights, and slide</strong> through dangerous environments, helping his friends and facing unique challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover how the Naals lived alongside Tee years before meeting Kadiha and her crew to embark on the grand journey of his life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Learn to use your tail</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Move yourself freely</strong> hanging around with your tail like a real naals</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930640/extras/08402a26b10c602df2e9d951301a8ada.poster.avif?t=1748953334\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930640/extras/08402a26b10c602df2e9d951301a8ada.webm?t=1748953334\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930640/extras/08402a26b10c602df2e9d951301a8ada.mp4?t=1748953334\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Destroy things and defend</strong> yourself from the Naltiune wildness</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930640/extras/551367314e08deb0447b981e3db9dd16.poster.avif?t=1748953334\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930640/extras/551367314e08deb0447b981e3db9dd16.webm?t=1748953334\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930640/extras/551367314e08deb0447b981e3db9dd16.mp4?t=1748953334\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interact with other characters</strong> and help them with their problems</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930640/extras/ba2bb8cf3e0dc250fdb6400eaba0399e.poster.avif?t=1748953334\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930640/extras/ba2bb8cf3e0dc250fdb6400eaba0399e.webm?t=1748953334\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930640/extras/ba2bb8cf3e0dc250fdb6400eaba0399e.mp4?t=1748953334\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Slide by branches</strong>, jump between them and reach the highest speed</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930640/extras/7678bfe10cff47254ce91dcaf3c665bd.poster.avif?t=1748953334\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930640/extras/7678bfe10cff47254ce91dcaf3c665bd.webm?t=1748953334\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930640/extras/7678bfe10cff47254ce91dcaf3c665bd.mp4?t=1748953334\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hang on animals</strong> that you need to complete your challenges</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930640/extras/0a2627d5b81d24c9e2b262fbba45ba6b.poster.avif?t=1748953334\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930640/extras/0a2627d5b81d24c9e2b262fbba45ba6b.webm?t=1748953334\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930640/extras/0a2627d5b81d24c9e2b262fbba45ba6b.mp4?t=1748953334\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pick objects and avoid obstacles</strong> by tubes and opened trunks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930640/extras/92fb3d4b885bcc34ececbc4a40557f83.poster.avif?t=1748953334\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930640/extras/92fb3d4b885bcc34ececbc4a40557f83.webm?t=1748953334\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930640/extras/92fb3d4b885bcc34ececbc4a40557f83.mp4?t=1748953334\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the world of Naltiune</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover unique and perilous landscapes that only the Naals have managed to inhabit for thousands of years.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master your long tail</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With Scark'Tee's versatile tail, <i>hook</i> and sway to maneuver through the environment, attack enemies, hang onto other animals, and slide through interior tubes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Help your friends</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter and assist other Naals on your journey, each with special abilities that will aid you in your quest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face challenges</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overcome obstacles and unique enemies lurking in Naltiune, from wild creatures to deadly traps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Captivating story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in an exciting narrative as you uncover the secrets of Naltiune and fight for the survival of the Naals.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Hook</i> into an intergalactic adventure with Scark'Tee, a fearless Naal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This <strong>3D platformer game based on hook physics</strong> offers a wild experience of speed and skill for players seeking a challenge, while providing <strong>free-roaming mechanics</strong> to discover the secrets of Naltiune as you improve the environment around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Latch onto an intergalactic adventure with Scark'Tee, a fearless Naals, and uncover the secrets of Naltiune, an inhospitable moon on the planet Aqueora, inhabited solely by the agile Naals. <strong>With his long tail, Scark'Tee swings, fights, and slide</strong> through dangerous environments, helping his friends and facing unique challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover how the Naals lived alongside Tee years before meeting Kadiha and her crew to embark on the grand journey of his life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Learn to use your tail</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Move yourself freely</strong> hanging around with your tail like a real naals</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930640/extras/08402a26b10c602df2e9d951301a8ada.poster.avif?t=1748953334\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930640/extras/08402a26b10c602df2e9d951301a8ada.webm?t=1748953334\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930640/extras/08402a26b10c602df2e9d951301a8ada.mp4?t=1748953334\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><str