bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the world of Naltiune</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover unique and perilous landscapes that only the Naals have managed to inhabit for thousands of years.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master your long tail</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With Scark'Tee's versatile tail, <i>hook</i> and sway to maneuver through the environment, attack enemies, hang onto other animals, and slide through interior tubes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Help your friends</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter and assist other Naals on your journey, each with special abilities that will aid you in your quest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face challenges</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overcome obstacles and unique enemies lurking in Naltiune, from wild creatures to deadly traps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Captivating story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in an exciting narrative as you uncover the secrets of Naltiune and fight for the survival of the Naals.</p>",
